hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"760","(72) Talaq ki kitab ka bab: Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Jurayj ne kaha: Abu al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Ayman maula Urwah ko Ibn Umar se sawal karte hue suna - jabke Abu al-Zubayr sun rahe the - to unhon ne kaha: Us shakhs ke bare mein aap kya kehte hain jisne apni biwi ko haiz ki halat mein talaq di? To unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko haiz ki halat mein talaq di, to Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Beshak Abdullah ibn Umar ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh usse ruju kare, to usne use mujh par lauta diya, aur kaha: Jab woh paak ho jaye to use talaq de ya rok le, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne kaha: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne tilawat farmayi: Aye Nabi! Jab tum auraton ko talaq do to unhe unki iddat ke liye talaq do, unki iddat ke aaghaz mein."
"761","Abu Sa'id al-Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nafi' ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Maine apni biwi ko talaq di."
"762","Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya - aur hadees unhi ki hai - unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, az Nafi', az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma, unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Umar ne iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare yahan tak ke woh paak ho jaye, phir use doosra haiz aaye, phir jab woh paak ho jaye to agar chahe use jima karne se pehle talaq de ya use rok le, kyunki yehi woh iddat hai jiska Allah ne hukm diya hai ke auraton ko uske liye talaq di jaye."
"763","Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne humein khabar di, az Anas ibn Sirin, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke woh haiza thin, to Umar ne iska zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare yahan tak ke woh paak ho jaye, to maine Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se kaha: Kya us talaq se iddat shumar hui? Unhon ne kaha: To phir kya!"
"764","Yusuf ibn Musa al-Qattan aur Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Muhammad ibn Isma'il al-Ahmasi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, az Sufyan, az Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman maula aal Talhah, az Salim, az Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke unhon ne apni biwi ko haiz mein talaq di - aur Za'farani ne kaha: jabke woh haiza thin - to Umar ne iska zikr Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se kiya to unhon ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke woh usse ruju kare, phir use paak ya hamila hone ki halat mein talaq de, Yusuf ne kaha: To Umar ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se sawal kiya."
"765","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, az Ibn Nafi', az Malik, az Ibn Shihab ke Sahl ibn Sa'd al-Sa'idi ne use khabar di ke Uwaymir al-Ajlani - phir unhon ne li'an ke qisse ka zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: To usne use teen talaqen de din is se pehle ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) use hukm dete, Ibn Shihab ne kaha: To yehi mula'ana karne wale miyan biwi ki sunnat thi."
"766","Muhammad ibn Awf ibn Sufyan al-Ta'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Duhaym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Awza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Zuhri se sawal kiya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki kin biwiyon ne Aapse panaah mangi? To unhon ne kaha: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe khabar di, az Aisha Raziallahu anha ke Jaun ki beti jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas dakhil huin aur Aap unke qareeb hue to unhon ne kaha: Main aapse Allah ki panaah mangti hun, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumne Bahut Bade ki panaah li, apne ghar walon se ja milo, Zuhri ne kaha: Apne ghar walon se ja milo ek talaq hai."
"767","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uthman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, az Zuhri, az Abu Salamah ke Aisha Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko apni biwiyon ko ikhtiyar dene ka hukm diya gaya to unhon ne mujh se ibtida ki aur farmaya: Main tumhe ek khabar sunata hun, aur tum par koi harj nahi ke jaldi na karo yahan tak ke apne walidain se mashwara kar lo, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne farmaya: Aye Nabi! Apni biwiyon se kaho: Agar tum duniya ki zindagi chahti ho - yahan tak ke pahunche - to beshak Allah ne tum mein se neko karon ke liye bahut bada ajr tayyar kar rakha hai, to maine kaha: Isme se kis baat mein main apne walidain se mashwara karun? Beshak main Allah aur Uske Rasool aur Aakhirat ke ghar ko chahti hun, unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ki biwiyon ne waisa hi kiya jaisa maine kiya."
"768","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani al-Qattan - ne hum se bayan kiya, az Isma'il, az Sha'bi, az Masruq, az Aisha Raziallahu anha, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne humein ikhtiyar diya, to kya woh talaq tha?"
"769","Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ibn Abdur Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail - yani Ibn Ulayyah - ne hum se Ayyub se, unhon ne Ikrimah se bayan kiya, ke Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma ne Barirah ke shohar ke bare mein kaha: Woh Mughith tha, Banu Fulan ka ghulam; Allah ki qasam goya main use abhi dekh raha hun ke woh Madinah ki galiyon mein us ke peeche peeche ro raha tha."
"770","Muhammad ibn Abdillah Abu Jafar al-Mukharrimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Hisham - woh al-Mughirah ibn Salamah al-Makhzumi hain - ne hum se Wuhayb se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Umar ne hum se Yazid ibn Ruman se, unhon ne Urwah se, unhon ne Aishah Raziallahu anha se bayan kiya: ke Barirah ka shohar ghulam tha."
"771","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salamah ne hum se Amir al-Ahwal se, unhon ne Amr ibn Shuayb se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis cheez ka malik na ho us mein na talaq hai, aur jis cheez ka malik na ho us mein na aazadi hai."
